---
import InlineLink from "@src/components/actions/inline-link/InlineLink.astro";
---

<section class="mt-16 border-t border-ink pt-8" aria-labelledby="what-i-do-heading">
  <h2 id="what-i-do-heading" class="text-[clamp(1.75rem,1.4rem+1.2vw,2.4rem)] tracking-[-0.03em]">
    What I do
  </h2>

  <div class="grid gap-x-8 gap-y-8 md:grid-cols-2">
    <div>
      <h3 class="text-[clamp(1.4rem,1.2rem+0.8vw,1.75rem)]">New products, fast</h3>

      <p class="mt-1 mb-0 max-w-[32rem]">
        I like a blank page. I helped win an
        <InlineLink href="/software/point-of-sale-android-rewrite/">Android point-of-sale rewrite</InlineLink> with a
        one-week prototype, then shipped it on a locked-down payment device. I was tech lead on a
        <InlineLink href="/software/serverless-insurance/">full motor-insurance journey</InlineLink> on AWS serverless,
        delivered in twelve months. Tests and pipelines were part of the work, so fast didn’t mean fragile.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div>
      <h3 class="text-[clamp(1.4rem,1.2rem+0.8vw,1.75rem)]">Legacy and migration</h3>

      <p class="mt-1 mb-0 max-w-[32rem]">
        I’m equally happy in an old system everyone is afraid to change. I
        <InlineLink href="/software/legacy-document-builder-replacement/">
          replaced an end-of-life document editor
        </InlineLink>{" "}
        in a single summer. I
        <InlineLink href="/software/build-it-again-better/" spacing="around">
          rebuilt a critical loan application and more than 50 Lambdas
        </InlineLink>
        with acceptance tests to prove nothing regressed. I got a
        <InlineLink href="/software/platform-modernisation-back-on-track/">time-critical PHP modernisation</InlineLink>{" "}
        back on track. And on{" "}
        <InlineLink href="/software/telecom-middleware-modernisation/">telecom middleware</InlineLink>, it was the
        testing culture that made four products safe to change.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
